{"user": "what will happen if I do a7", "user_ts": "2026-08-21T13:53:10.169623+00:00", "assistant": "If Black plays **a7**, it flips **a6** and **b7** to Black.\n\nBut then White will have replies like **a3**, **b6**, **b8**, or **c8**. The worry is **White a3**: it flips a long line down the **a-file** and also across row 3, so many of the discs you just gained can swing back.\n\nSo ask: after **a7**, are those edge gains stable, or are you giving White a stronger sweep?", "assistant_started_ts": "2026-08-21T13:53:31.196388+00:00", "assistant_ts": "2026-08-21T13:53:33.340256+00:00", "annotation_user": {"final": ["Common Ground Question"], "consensus": ["Common Ground Question"], "votes": {"Common Ground Question": 3}, "confidence": {"Common Ground Question": 1.0}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Common Ground Question"], "llama": ["Common Ground Question"], "sonnet": ["Common Ground Question"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false}, "annotation_assistant_fine": {"final": ["Local Justification", "Worked Line", "Prompt"], "consensus": ["Local Justification", "Worked Line", "Prompt"], "votes": {"Board Report": 1, "Local Justification": 3, "Worked Line": 3, "Prompt": 3}, "confidence": {"Board Report": 0.3333333333333333, "Local Justification": 1.0, "Worked Line": 1.0, "Prompt": 1.0}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Board Report", "Local Justification", "Worked Line", "Prompt"], "llama": ["Local Justification", "Worked Line", "Prompt"], "sonnet": ["Local Justification", "Worked Line", "Prompt"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false, "coarse": ["Direct Instruction", "Prompt"]}}
